# Environment variables live with the app/worker that needs them, each
# documented in its own .env.example. Copy the relevant one to .env.local
# (frontends) or .dev.vars (the api worker) and fill in values. .env.local
# and .dev.vars are gitignored. Never commit real secrets.
# See docs/specs/002-project-scope/secrets-policy.md for the full policy.
#
# Where to look:
#   apps/editor/.env.example     NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE, sign-in toggle, telemetry toggle + URL
#   apps/help/.env.example       NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE, telemetry toggle + URL
#   apps/api/.env.example        liveworkspace accounts and index, Resend,
#                                telemetry + TELEMETRY_KEY (Worker vars/secrets)
#   apps/mcp/.env.example        CONSENT_BASE_URL, TELEMETRY_KEY (Worker vars/secrets)
#
# The repo root itself needs no env vars.
